      "created_at": "2025-09-23T05:50:19.023Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In data import select “update existing Documents” .then download the all Item code with Conversion factor and uom field from UOM table.<br>\nThen update the factors and UOM in excel.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/1/91ef5a625e5e55eec8a4d21605f049958e997477.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/91ef5a625e5e55eec8a4d21605f049958e997477\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/1/91ef5a625e5e55eec8a4d21605f049958e997477.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"kP02MamXzbgLTgDPtqzhdkIbDhl\" width=\"641\" height=\"251\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">641×251 10.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\nThen you can attach and import using Data import.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/c/fc310a33b5589f8675f217f04a6b80f17ba7477e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/fc310a33b5589f8675f217f04a6b80f17ba7477e\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/c/fc310a33b5589f8675f217f04a6b80f17ba7477e_2_690x315.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"zYZoaY6Scq8n5g6kd6BgQTS9nAO\" width=\"690\" height=\"315\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/c/fc310a33b5589f8675f217f04a6b80f17ba7477e_2_690x315.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/c/fc310a33b5589f8675f217f04a6b80f17ba7477e_2_1035x472.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/c/fc310a33b5589f8675f217f04a6b80f17ba7477e_2_1380x630.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1701×778 52 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
